 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Passive with agent",
     "texto": [
      "It is formed with the short passive participle, which agrees with the subject, and the agent goes in the instrumental: **Текст написан учёным** («The text is written by a scientist»). **Дом построен нашей командой** («The house is built by our team»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Past and future",
     "texto": [
      "In the past **был**, **была** or **были** is used with the participle: **Книга была написана в прошлом году** («The book was written last year»). In the future: **книга будет написана** («the book will be written»). The participle agrees with the Russian subject."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
